    duplicate_of: []  # ce6e
    not_duplicate_of: []  # ce6e
    pr_ref:  # ce6e
    description: "Add optional --dataflow flag to slice command. When set, BFS only\nfollows edges where a write/mutate at the source connects to a read\nat the destination — producing tighter slices of actual data dependencies.\n\n~10 lines in slice.py BFS loop to check edge.meta.get(\"access_mode\").\nCLI arg addition in cli.py.\n\nWithout flag: existing behavior (follow all edges). Backward compatible.\n\nDepends on: edges actually having access_mode annotations (all prior items).\nSee ADR-0015 §6."  # ce6e
    fields: {}  # ce6e
